id=extradim_toggle
name=Extra Dim Toggle
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=bossku
description=Installs the Extra Dim Toggle app (screen, Quick Settings tile, home widget) on flash and re-installs it on boot if missing. After flashing, open KernelSU manager and grant root to "Extra Dim Toggle", then toggle Reduce Bright Colors from the tile, widget, or app.
